### 1. 先添加一个专业
POST http://localhost:8080/major/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "majorCode": "CS01",
  "majorName": "计算机科学与技术",
  "planInside": 30,
  "planOutside": 5
}

### 2. 再添加一个考生（该专业下）
POST http://localhost:8080/student/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "examId": "2024001",
  "name": "张三",
  "gender": "男",
  "age": 22,
  "political": "共青团员",
  "isFresh": 1,
  "education": "本科",
  "source": "大连民族大学",
  "majorCode": "CS01",
  "type": "全日制"
}

### 3. 测试删除专业（应该报错）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/major/delete/CS01

### 4. 录入初试成绩
POST http://localhost:8080/first_score/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "examId": "2024001",
  "politics": 75,
  "english": 68,
  "professionalBase": 120
}

### 5. 筛选复试名单（例如：政治≥60，英语≥60，专业基础≥90，总分≥250）
GET http://localhost:8080/first_score/check?politicsLine=60&englishLine=60&professionalBaseLine=90&totalScoreLine=250

### 6. 录入复试成绩
POST http://localhost:8080/second_score/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "examId": "2024001",
  "professional": 85,
  "interview": 90,
  "computerTest": 88
}

### 7. 生成录取名单（总分线 360 分，例如：初试263 + 复试263 = 526）
POST http://localhost:8080/admission/generate?totalScoreLine=360

### 8. 查询录取名单
GET http://localhost:8080/admission/list


### 9. 各科成绩统计
GET http://localhost:8080/stats/subject

### 10. 分数段统计
GET http://localhost:8080/stats/segment

### 11. 录取生源分析
GET http://localhost:8080/stats/admission

### 12. 触发 /stats/admission 报错（用于查看 SQL 日志）
GET http://localhost:8080/stats/admission

